Saa WILL TO GO mirai he to PLAY ON!

02:01.780 --> 02:05.200
That race began in 1903.

02:06.620 --> 02:12.380
A difficult journey, up to 3,500 kilometers long and with heights that reached up to 2,000 meters.

02:13.500 --> 02:17.710
Cyclists do nothing but pedal for over three weeks.

02:19.630 --> 02:24.050
Their race is being broadcasted in more than 190 countries.

02:24.970 --> 02:28.810
And along the road, there are more than 15 million spectators cheering for them.

02:30.310 --> 02:32.150
The Alps. The Pyrenees.

02:33.060 --> 02:35.860
The cyclist ride through 2,000 meter high mountains.

02:36.990 --> 02:41.160
With a few reaching speeds of over 100 km/h on the down slopes, normally taking one's breath away

02:43.200 --> 02:47.790
This sport, that started when bicycles were a main means of transportation.

02:48.910 --> 02:51.920
Receives much enthusiasm from the public and continues to evolve.

02:52.920 --> 02:56.670
Even now when bicycles have been replaced by the automobile.

02:59.340 --> 03:05.140
The Tour de France.

03:06.390 --> 03:08.270
A sacred place for all cyclists.

03:10.440 --> 03:11.230
And right now...

03:18.320 --> 03:23.950
Everyone in Japan, right now, and I mean right at this point in time, a new chapter in history is about to take place!

03:24.950 --> 03:28.490
The world's largest cycling race, the Tour of France.

03:28.750 --> 03:33.370
Considered to be the most intense sport known, making 10 billion people in the world go crazy over it!

03:33.540 --> 03:38.210
Shockingly, the person in first place right now is Japanese!

03:38.420 --> 03:39.670
It's Mikoto Shinozaki!

03:40.590 --> 03:45.800
Boy meets bicycle. (Part. 1)

04:28.970 --> 04:31.140
It stopped.

04:35.480 --> 04:37.650
It hurts.

04:39.820 --> 04:41.780
I've' brought everybody's lunch.

04:42.150 --> 04:44.070
You bastard, put the foothold down!

04:44.530 --> 04:45.740
My scooter!

04:45.860 --> 04:49.070
Umm, well, actually...

04:49.410 --> 04:51.540
If you don't know how to ride, then you shouldn't ride it!

04:51.790 --> 04:53.450
I'm really sorry!

04:53.660 --> 04:58.250
That idiot made the food go all over the place.

04:58.790 --> 05:00.170
Hey, is there going to be enough for everyone?

05:00.670 --> 05:03.420
Eh, I'm sure that I bough enough for everyone.

05:04.170 --> 05:06.510
Ah, sorry, sorry, it's all here.

05:11.350 --> 05:16.940
Well, I had to pay for everything, so could you pay me back later?

05:17.350 --> 05:19.730
I'm sorry for always troubling you, boy.

05:21.730 --> 05:22.520
It's fine.

05:38.960 --> 05:43.420
Hello everyone. My name is Mikoto Shinozaki.

05:44.050 --> 05:48.340
I'm just an average high school student who just had a school entrance ceremony the other day.

05:49.090 --> 05:53.680
My heart begins to pound when I say I'm a high school student, as it makes me feel like I'm an adult.

05:54.930 --> 06:00.020
There, a dream-like world awaits you, where you can make cool friends,

06:00.690 --> 06:04.070
As well as fall in love.

06:06.860 --> 06:07.570
However...

06:43.110 --> 06:46.940
Ahh, I wonder if there's anything out there that I'm capable of.

08:26.290 --> 08:27.670
Huh, there's still someone here.

08:29.300 --> 08:31.050
Ahh, Shinozaki-san?

08:32.720 --> 08:33.380
Fu-Fukazawa-san.

08:35.300 --> 08:36.970
I didn't realize you and I went to the same school.

08:37.010 --> 08:41.930
Uh, yes! I've been sitting next to you since about last week.

08:42.390 --> 08:43.980
I see. I didn't realize.

08:46.060 --> 08:46.650
Umm...

08:47.190 --> 08:47.400
What?

08:48.940 --> 08:51.070
Your hair has grown longer, hasn't it?

08:53.030 --> 08:56.280
Eh, I got a haircut just before the school entrance ceremony.

08:56.780 --> 09:00.280
I-I know! But its grown about seven millimeters longer.

09:00.990 --> 09:03.830
Seven millimeters?

09:04.210 --> 09:05.910
Yes... Well, umm...

09:07.080 --> 09:11.050
Ah, let me guess, you're interested in me, aren't you?

09:11.420 --> 09:15.010
No, umm...

09:19.430 --> 09:22.060
Sorry, I already have a boyfriend.

09:22.930 --> 09:26.430
I-I know. I heard that he's a college student.

09:27.020 --> 09:33.320
Yep. He's boring, but he has money and a car.

09:33.990 --> 09:37.990
No, that is... I just happened to over hear it in the hallways.

09:38.950 --> 09:42.780
Shinozaki, have you ever looked yourself over in something like this.

09:43.290 --> 09:45.000
Not really, no.

09:45.450 --> 09:50.880
Right? Well, despite my age, I've been out with several guys.

09:51.460 --> 09:52.880
I've done the whole hand holding thing.

09:52.960 --> 09:53.300
Hands!?

09:53.840 --> 09:55.210
While look at you, Shinozaki.

09:55.800 --> 09:59.430
A cycle of you coming to school, and then going back home, just to repeat it over again, right?

10:00.180 --> 10:06.220
And then what's up with your hair?

10:06.560 --> 10:09.270
Your neck-tie is backwards, and your shirt is inside out.

10:09.350 --> 10:10.190
It shouldn't be...

10:10.440 --> 10:11.440
Your pants are unzipped.

10:14.110 --> 10:18.530
Shinozaki, have you ever considered changing yourself?

10:20.660 --> 10:24.830
You know, you should care more about your own appearance when you like someone.

10:25.330 --> 10:28.410
Your appearance says a lot about how much someone is worth to you.

10:32.540 --> 10:38.970
Oh yeah, Shinozaki, have you joined any clubs yet?

10:39.340 --> 10:43.300
No, I haven't joined one yet.

10:43.680 --> 10:46.680
All right! I might be able to buy that purse.

10:46.930 --> 10:47.220
Huh?

10:48.270 --> 10:50.020
Do you want to join the bicycle club?

10:50.440 --> 10:50.770
Huh?

10:51.900 --> 10:55.270
It your be really good for you.

10:55.650 --> 11:00.900
You see Shinozaki, you don't look like you have many friends.

11:01.030 --> 11:03.410
If you're going to join a club, join a sports club. I think you would be able to make a lot of friends there.

11:03.530 --> 11:06.410
Shinozaki, although you look like you're not athletic, this can still raise your social status.

11:06.790 --> 11:09.750
Perhaps it can even attract some girls.

11:10.080 --> 11:12.830
There will also be a manager, and it's possible you could fall in love with each other during training camp.

11:13.580 --> 11:15.590
What is this Bicycle club?

11:20.050 --> 11:23.550
I'll just have to give up on buying the purse.

11:24.470 --> 11:25.140
Bye.

11:25.680 --> 11:32.810
Wait... umm, well... umm, Fukazawa... I would like to...

11:33.190 --> 11:33.980
What is it?

11:38.110 --> 11:39.730
U-U-Umm, wait!

11:40.360 --> 11:41.070
What is it?

11:41.650 --> 11:46.780
Right, I umm... I would like to draw a picture of you.

11:47.490 --> 11:48.540
Nude?

11:51.750 --> 11:53.420
No, not that!

11:59.670 --> 12:03.430
However, if you'd prefer it, I wouldn't mind drawing a picture of you nude.

12:03.550 --> 12:04.470
Ah, no thanks.

12:05.800 --> 12:08.220
Umm... I will try to finish this drawing quickly.

12:08.680 --> 12:12.640
It doesn't matter. This is my first time being a model. It looks fun.

12:13.230 --> 12:14.230
You better draw me cute.

12:14.730 --> 12:17.060
Yes. Well, I'll begin now.

12:17.360 --> 12:17.940
Go ahead.

12:23.110 --> 12:24.240
She's really cute.

12:26.120 --> 12:31.370
Umm, could you please not stare at me as much? it gets me distracted.

12:31.750 --> 12:38.250
Roger. Oh yeah, could you draw stars in my eyes with roses in the background?

12:43.340 --> 12:46.510
Oh yeah, was it today that we had promised to go sing karaoke?

12:49.600 --> 12:52.060
Nope, I didn't. When was it then?

13:01.570 --> 13:02.980
W-What?

13:03.570 --> 13:07.490
I'll imagine her.

13:07.990 --> 13:16.040
Her voice, and her body temperature, that quiet, that self assurance, that brilliance, let's bring them into my world now!

13:37.190 --> 13:41.900
I-I'm sorry. I went overboard again.

13:43.440 --> 13:45.490
Just now he might have looked like Yousuke...

13:46.950 --> 13:51.410
I'm really very sorry. Sorry, sorry.

13:51.620 --> 13:52.870
Can I take a look at it?

13:54.080 --> 13:54.990
S-Sure.

13:56.210 --> 13:57.500
Please, please look.

13:57.960 --> 13:58.500
"Please look?"

14:01.340 --> 14:10.590
I wasn't able to fully express you as I had imagined. B-But I I think if I get a little closer I'll be able to.

14:12.470 --> 14:13.760
Why am I wearing a bathing suit?!

14:22.110 --> 14:26.190
I wonder if she's angry with me.

14:26.940 --> 14:30.990
I've been told that I get caught up in the moment, and become completely unaware of my surroundings,

14:31.200 --> 14:36.370
so I've been trying to be careful.

14:36.750 --> 14:38.200
Here it is, Shinozaki.

14:39.120 --> 14:39.500
Huh?

14:40.880 --> 14:41.670
This thing.

14:44.420 --> 14:45.340
A bicycle

14:48.090 --> 14:49.300
Want to try riding it for a second?

14:49.840 --> 14:52.590
Well, no... That is...

14:53.050 --> 14:56.760
Yousuke said that... Oh, he's my idiot brother.

14:57.220 --> 15:04.360
He is the Captain of the Bicycle club.

15:05.360 --> 15:05.980
So, what do you think?

15:07.230 --> 15:16.200
B-But I'm not good at sports. And I run really slow. And also, anything that has to do with bicycles...

15:16.700 --> 15:18.950
Actually a cyclist's muscles used to pedal a bicycle are unique.

15:19.580 --> 15:23.670
Compared to the ones used in daily activities and sports, they're completely different.

15:24.000 --> 15:27.460
So, just because someone is a fast runner, doesn't mean they'll be a fast cyclist.

15:28.090 --> 15:29.550
Honestly, it's completely different.

15:29.970 --> 15:33.800
There may be someone just like you, who is a slow runner and a bad athlete,

15:34.010 --> 15:36.640
but is really talented at cycling.

15:39.520 --> 15:39.930
Don't you agree?

15:45.060 --> 15:49.030
I-Is that so? But then, that has to be a lot of work for you,

15:49.740 --> 15:53.150
as you can't really tell who's talented in cycling.

15:56.160 --> 15:59.490
What do you think is the most important factor in a talented cyclist?

16:03.540 --> 16:07.670
Right there..

16:07.800 --> 16:10.420
The stringer their heart is, the stronger of a weapon it'll be in the world of cycling.

16:10.970 --> 16:12.470
That's what Yousuke said.

16:13.050 --> 16:16.140
In that case, I'm not really suitable.

16:16.760 --> 16:19.850
I am timid, and am always picked on by others.

16:20.270 --> 16:21.980
That doesn't matter.

16:22.390 --> 16:25.940
What's important is a strong will that you can focus on one thing.

16:26.360 --> 16:27.730
The strength of your heart,

16:27.820 --> 16:30.480
being able to unleash all of your strength at one important moment.

16:30.990 --> 16:34.570
My brother told me to bring people who can't be measured in that aspect.

16:35.450 --> 16:36.110
Bicycle Club, I...

16:39.660 --> 16:42.250
Think that you, Shinozaki, have fulfilled that condition.

16:45.120 --> 16:45.670
Most likely.

16:46.460 --> 16:47.170
"Most likely?"

16:47.460 --> 16:50.670
Yeah, you'd be shocked how much of that is woman's intuition.

16:51.090 --> 16:56.510
So, why not join the bicycle club?

16:57.180 --> 17:05.600
But, umm... To tell the truth, I can't... That is... I don't know how to ride a bicycle.

17:15.240 --> 17:16.650
That's...

17:17.360 --> 17:22.410
That's why, I... Can't join!

17:22.700 --> 17:23.410
Hey, hold on.

17:31.170 --> 17:33.550
Wonderful!

17:34.380 --> 17:38.130
High school life is really wonderful.

17:38.590 --> 17:42.100
When I noticed her sitting next to me on the first day at school.

17:42.850 --> 17:46.230
And then I actually got to speak with her today.

17:47.520 --> 17:51.310
We were in the same class in our first year of middle school.

17:51.900 --> 17:55.070
Of course, no one was more beautiful than her.

17:56.070 --> 17:58.650
She had a really cute voice as well.

18:01.280 --> 18:06.830
But Fukazawa-san would never pay any interest in me.

18:07.410 --> 18:09.790
Quickly eat, or else I can't clear the table.

18:11.630 --> 18:12.420
I'm slow,

18:15.550 --> 18:16.420
and clumsy.

18:17.170 --> 18:20.430
I sometimes ask if it's all right for me to stay like this.

18:21.470 --> 18:23.600
I wonder why I'm hiding it, when I'm the only person in here.

18:25.560 --> 18:29.310
Yet, I was told I had the ability.

18:47.700 --> 18:48.580
Onii-chan?

18:53.040 --> 18:55.960
Mother! Onii-chan is drowning!

18:56.050 --> 18:56.960
Again?

19:01.890 --> 19:04.430
Ah, this feels nice.

19:05.310 --> 19:09.600
Huh? But, why?

19:12.810 --> 19:17.280
It's a bicycle.

19:18.740 --> 19:26.370
Wait a minute,

19:26.540 --> 19:28.290
Hey, where do you want to go now?

19:28.750 --> 19:32.420
Huh?

19:41.880 --> 19:42.550
A dream?

19:43.470 --> 19:50.390
How come it was like that? Although it was a dream, I can't believe I was riding together with Fukazawa-san on a bicycle,

19:50.640 --> 19:53.690
On top of that, her breasts were really big and she was wearing a bathing suit!

20:07.370 --> 20:11.700
The most important aspect of a cyclist is here,

20:13.370 --> 20:16.000
I think you have a unique heart in you.

20:23.930 --> 20:25.840
I have gone to school, please don't look for me.

20:23.930 --> 20:25.840
‌‌ ‌

20:23.930 --> 20:25.840
‌‌ ‌‌Mikoto

20:26.510 --> 20:29.150
Calm down.

20:29.310 --> 20:31.310
Getting worked up about going outside in the middle of the night is really pathetic.

20:36.020 --> 20:41.070
I'll be fine.

21:26.200 --> 21:31.780
Although during the day I didn't notice anything... bicycles sure are beautiful.

21:32.870 --> 21:34.160
But even so, I'm too careless.

21:39.040 --> 21:40.580
What was that?

21:42.920 --> 21:44.170
Oh, static electricity.

21:49.550 --> 21:52.560
Will you accept me, even if I'm just me?

22:08.400 --> 22:12.690
Kaze ga toorisugiteku

22:08.400 --> 22:12.690
The wind glides by,

22:13.280 --> 22:17.200
Karada wo surinukete

22:13.280 --> 22:17.200
Brushing against our body.

22:17.530 --> 22:22.990
Itsushika iro ase bokete shimatta

22:17.530 --> 22:22.990
The colors faded in the farthest end of the sky,

22:23.040 --> 22:27.120
Sora no saihate de

22:23.040 --> 22:27.120
before we realized.

22:28.170 --> 22:36.170
Nama atatakai kaze ga fuiteru fuiteru

22:28.170 --> 22:36.170
The luke warm breeze is blowing, blowing.

22:37.800 --> 22:41.600
Mujun darake no sekai de

22:37.800 --> 22:41.600
In a world full on inconsistency,

22:41.720 --> 22:47.430
Toke sou no kimi ga futto boku ni waraikaketa

22:41.720 --> 22:47.430
Melting into it, you grin at me with a whiff.

22:56.360 --> 23:00.950
Kaze ga toorisugiteku

22:56.360 --> 23:00.950
The wind glides by,

23:01.200 --> 23:04.830
Karada wo surinukete

23:01.200 --> 23:04.830
Brushing against our body.

23:05.410 --> 23:10.920
Itsushika a iro ase bokete shimatta

23:05.410 --> 23:10.920
The colors faded before we realized.

23:11.000 --> 23:20.130
Sora no saihate de aou

23:11.000 --> 23:20.130
Let's meet at the furthest end of the sky.
